h\" >&quot;Walking simulator&quot; genre;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with objects and solve puzzles to progress through the story;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the secret hidden within an almost-forgotten depot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a haunting environment with detailed locations;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich 3D sound that fully envelops you in the atmosphere;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short playtime, allowing you to complete the game in one evening and maintain suspense until the very end.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240310/extras/d798d57ac9e6b01a127f4ff2cead5f69.poster.avif?t=1755544908\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240310/extras/d798d57ac9e6b01a127f4ff2cead5f69.webm?t=1755544908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240310/extras/d798d57ac9e6b01a127f4ff2cead5f69.mp4?t=1755544908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>email: <a href=\"mailto:deformeddreams@gmail.com\">deformeddreams@gmail.com</a></i></p>",
    "short_description": "The Derailed is a first-person psychological horror game. Beneath the dusty arches of a nearly forgotten depot, shadows of the past tremble. Whether you want to or not, you will have to uncover the dark secrets of this place.",
